<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillard Department Stores.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillard Department Stores.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Montgomery Securities analyst Tom Tashjian said he lowered his rating on Dillard Department Stores to a hold from a buy.</p>
<p>--No further information on the reason for the downgrade was immediately available.</p>
</text>
